cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "VERITAS-TS"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of VERITAS-TS, which checks the evidence that a time series
  classifier cites with two realistic, graph-aware counterfactual edits and uses the
  pass-or-fail verdict as a reinforcement learning reward for LLM and non-LLM agents.
version: 1.0.0
